            "text": "noncomputable def momentMap (P : Patch) (lam : ℝ) (c : Coeff) : Coeff :=\n  ![∫ x, weightedChange P lam c (-1) x,\n    ∫ x, weightedChange P lam c 0 x,\n    ∫ x, x ^ (1 / 2 : ℝ) * correction P c x]"
